## API Integration

### Authentication Endpoints
- `POST /api/v1/auth/register` - User registration
- `POST /api/v1/auth/login` - User login (returns JWT token)
- `GET /api/v1/auth/me` - Get current user info

### Project Endpoints
- `POST /api/v1/projects` - Create project
- `GET /api/v1/projects/` - List all projects
- `GET /api/v1/projects/{id}` - Get project details
- `PUT /api/v1/projects/{id}` - Update project
- `DELETE /api/v1/projects/{id}` - Delete project

### Design Endpoints
- `POST /api/v1/design/generate` - Generate design with parameters

### Analysis Endpoints
- `POST /api/v1/cost/predict` - Predict construction cost
- `POST /api/v1/timeline/predict` - Predict project timeline
- `POST /api/v1/risk/analyze` - Analyze project risks
- `POST /api/v1/boq/generate` - Generate Bill of Quantities
- `POST /api/v1/chat/ask` - AI assistant chat

