## Data Models

### User
- id: number
- full_name: string
- email: string
- role: string (Individual, Contractor, Architect, Engineer)
- created_at: timestamp

### Project
- id: number
- project_name: string
- user_id: number
- country: string
- state: string
- city: string
- postal_code: string
- locality: string
- plot_area: number
- construction_area: number
- building_type: string
- floors: number
- material_type: string
- design_style: string
- budget: number (optional)
- created_at: timestamp
- updated_at: timestamp

### Design
- id: number
- project_id: number
- floor_plan_url: string
- exterior_concept_url: string
- interior_concept_url: string
- design_style: string
- design_metadata: object (style, building_type, total_area, total_floors)
- ground_floor: object (rooms with dimensions)
- upper_floors: array of floor objects
- created_at: timestamp

